# Promotion requires an explicit process

## Rule

Promotion from `outputs/` to `release/` MUST be performed by an explicit process. That process MAY be manual or automated. Producing a candidate does not implicitly promote it.

## Notes

Draft corporate rule proposed during the IASI methodology exercise. Requires corporate approval before becoming binding.
